sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Bolt Driver
    participant Bolt as sedandelivery-bolt
    participant QE as QueryExecutor
    participant Redis as RedisGraphStore
    participant Stream as Redis Stream changelog
    participant Sync as fabric-sync sidecar
    participant Fabric as Microsoft Fabric

    Client->>Bolt: RUN CREATE Person name Eve db social
    Bolt->>QE: parse plan execute
    QE->>Redis: create_node social Person name Eve
    Redis-->>QE: NodeId 42
    Redis->>Stream: XADD changelog op CREATE_NODE id 42
    QE-->>Bolt: QueryResult nodes_created 1
    Bolt-->>Client: SUCCESS bookmark

    Note over Sync: Polling loop SD2_SYNC_BLOCK_MS 1000
    Sync->>Stream: XREADGROUP GROUP fabric-sync BLOCK 1000
    Stream-->>Sync: op CREATE_NODE id 42 labels Person
    Sync->>Fabric: POST openCypher CREATE Person name Eve
    Fabric-->>Sync: 200 OK
    Sync->>Stream: XACK changelog fabric-sync msg-id

    Note over Sync: On failure after max retries
    Sync->>Sync: XADD dead-letter queue
